## Key Concepts
- CMEK-based envelope encryption with per-tenant DEKs
- External KMS integration and key-wrapping
- Zero-downtime rotation and revocation workflows
- Tamper-evident auditing using Merkle proofs
- Tenant-to-key metadata, APIs, and test strategies

## Code Example
